  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large paella pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced zucchini to the paella pan and cook for 3 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Add the cooked black quinoa, brown rice, and cassava flour to the paella pan and stir to combine.",
    "Add the fermented jang, garlic, and vegetable broth to the paella pan and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the grated fresh coconut and Brazilian red peppers to the paella pan and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 5 minutes, or until the paella is heated through and the flavors have melded together.",
    "Season with pink salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
